  "method": "Same optional phase instrumentation in both binaries; 2 warmups then 10 individual native wheels; 10 XTest button clicks deliver 20 native wheels. CSS viewport 640x400, 300 rows. No overlapping Cargo or benchmarks. Medians are observations, not CI thresholds. Debug before page bounds use identical deterministic desktop geometry verified by whole-page pixel comparison.",
  "limitations": "X11 synthetic input only; no physical macOS/Wayland measurement. Scroll events are coalesced per rendering opportunity: old burst delivered one, new burst delivers progress. Every wheel and accumulated scroll position are preserved. Adjusted tree still constructed once per scroll generation; no stripe repaint or content-visibility policy change.",
